{%- comment -%}
  GLYDE homepage structured data. This snippet is intentionally guarded so it can
  be rendered from theme.liquid without emitting homepage entities on other pages.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'index' -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign organization_id = canonical_url | append: '#organization'
    assign website_id = canonical_url | append: '#website'
    assign primary_image_id = canonical_url | append: '#primaryimage'
    assign webpage_id = canonical_url | append: '#webpage'
    assign product_id = canonical_url | append: '#product'
    assign faq_id = canonical_url | append: '#faq'
    assign organization_logo_url = 'logo.png' | asset_url | prepend: 'https:'
    assign hero_image_url = 'hero-photo.png' | asset_url | prepend: 'https:'
    assign product_image_url = 'body-image-1.png' | asset_url | prepend: 'https:'
  -%}

  {%- capture page_name -%}GLYDE Smart Auto-Fade Clipper | Perfect Fades at Home{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture page_description -%}Meet GLYDE, the smart auto-fade hair clipper with guided cuts, real-time sensing, and adjustable blade control for consistent fades at home.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture product_name -%}GLYDE Smart Auto-Fade Clipper{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture product_description -%}GLYDE is a smart auto-fade hair clipper with app-guided cuts, real-time motion and angle sensing, automatic blade protection, and adjustable blade control for consistent fades at home.{%- endcapture -%}

  {%- capture faq_1_question -%}Is GLYDE beginner-friendly?{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_1_answer -%}Yes. GLYDE is designed for people with little or no haircutting experience. Simply choose a hairstyle in the app and follow the step-by-step visual and audio guidance. As you cut, GLYDE automatically adjusts the blade to help you achieve a smooth, even result.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_2_question -%}How does GLYDE create an automatic fade?{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_2_answer -%}Built-in sensors track the clipper’s movement distance, speed, tilt, and angle in real time. GLYDE then automatically adjusts the cutting length as you move. The fade-band marks where the fade should begin, helping create a smooth and consistent transition between lengths.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_3_question -%}Can I use GLYDE to cut my own hair?{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_3_answer -%}Yes. GLYDE is designed to make self-haircuts easier with step-by-step guidance in the app. If it’s your first time, we recommend starting with a simple style, taking your time, and using a mirror for areas that are harder to see.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_4_question -%}What hairstyles and hair types does GLYDE support?{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_4_answer -%}GLYDE is designed primarily for short hairstyles, including buzz cuts, crew cuts, side parts, fades, tapers, and side-and-back touch-ups. It is not currently designed for long hairstyles, very curly hair, or skin fades.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_5_question -%}How does GLYDE help prevent mistakes?{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_5_answer -%}GLYDE continuously monitors how you move and holds the clipper. If you move too quickly or use an incorrect angle, it can adjust the cutting length and provide guidance to help reduce harsh lines, uneven transitions, and accidental overcutting. For the best results, follow the app and move slowly and steadily.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_6_question -%}Does the GLYDE app work offline?{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_6_answer -%}Yes. Once you’ve completed the initial setup and downloaded your chosen hairstyle, you can follow the guidance without Wi-Fi or mobile data. You’ll still need an internet connection to download new styles, sync content, and install updates.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_7_question -%}How long does the battery last, and how do I clean GLYDE?{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture faq_7_answer -%}GLYDE has a 2600mAh battery and provides approximately two hours of runtime on a full charge. It charges via USB-C. GLYDE is not waterproof, so do not rinse or submerge it in water. After each use, clean the blade with the included brush and apply lubricating oil as needed.{%- endcapture -%}

